.Dd 2026-05-30
.Dt NOMAD-INSTALL-FIELD-DESK 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm nomad-install-field-desk
.Nd install SysAdminDoc NOMAD Field Desk alongside the admin
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm nomad install-field-desk
.Op Fl -port Ar N
.Op Fl -foreground
.Op Fl -force
.Sh DESCRIPTION
NOMAD Field Desk is a separate preparedness desktop app from
.Lk https://github.com/SysAdminDoc/project-nomad-desktop "SysAdminDoc/project-nomad-desktop" .
It is a distinct product, not part of this distribution's lineage, but it
coexists cleanly: it runs side-by-side with the Crosstalk admin and shares the
single native Metal Ollama daemon on port 11434 for its AI Chat tab.
.Pp
This command downloads the
.Pa NOMADFieldDesk-macOS
release binary into
.Pa ~/Applications/ ,
verifies it against the release's
.Pa SHA256SUMS.txt
(defense in depth; a missing sums file is a warning, not fatal), and launches it
loopback-only on port 8081. It first checks that the chosen port is free
(refusing it only if something other than Field Desk or Python is listening) and
notes whether the admin (port 8080) and Ollama (port 11434) are up. Re-running
without
.Fl -force
reuses an already-downloaded binary.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl -port Ar N
Port to serve Field Desk on. Defaults to 8081, or the value of the
.Ev NOMAD_FIELD_DESK_PORT
environment variable.
.It Fl -foreground
Run Field Desk in the foreground so its stderr is visible, instead of launching
it detached with
.Xr nohup 1 .
.It Fl -force
Re-download the binary even if one is already present at the target path.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ic nomad install-field-desk
Download (if needed), verify, and launch Field Desk on port 8081.
.It Ic nomad install-field-desk --port 8090 --foreground
Run on port 8090 in the foreground to watch its output.
.It Ic nomad install-field-desk --force
Force a fresh download of the latest binary, then launch.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width "NOMAD_FIELD_DESK_PORT"
.It Ev NOMAD_FIELD_DESK_PORT
Default port when
.Fl -port
is not given (otherwise 8081).
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr nomad 1 ,
.Xr nomad-uninstall-field-desk 1 ,
.Xr nomad-reset-ollama 1
